        <p>图 3　跨服务调用与失败补偿（源自《详细设计说明》图 27）</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="620" topLeftY="104" width="284" height="22">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源黑体" bold="true" color="rgba(13,19,38,1)" wrap="false">
